    question:'A class must decide whether a person deserves a place in a display about people who shaped the country.<br>Which test is the most useful?',
    options:['Did their work change how people live long after they stopped working?','Were they widely talked about and photographed while they were still alive?','Did they hold the most senior job that was available at the time?','Were they born on the island rather than arriving from abroad?'],
